<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 21/22.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 21/22.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>21/22. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  April 21/22     April 18-21</p>
<p> CZK	0.44779	  0.45738</p>
<p> DKK	2.09748	  2.09919</p>
<p> FIM	2.6456	   2.64055</p>
<p> HUF	0.07578	  0.07608</p>
<p> JPY	0.10856	  0.10899</p>
<p> LTL	3.40418	  3.43279</p>
<p> LVL     23.46221	 23.59838</p>
<p> RUR	0.00237	  0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.78229	  1.78432</p>
<p> UAH	7.39158	  7.45978</p>
<p> USD     13.6116	  13.726</p>
<p> XEU     15.57643	 15.63048</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
